  "checkpoint": 9,
  "title": "Boarding the Train",
  "summary": "O trem expresso chega à plataforma quatro, Paul encontra seu assento perto da janela e se acomoda para a viagem rumo às montanhas.",
  "audio_url": "/audios/book-25.mp3",
  "word_count_target": 140,
  "story_en": "The long silver train slows to a complete stop along platform four. The automatic doors slide open with a hiss of air. Passengers begin to step inside carrying their bags.\n\nPaul climbs the metal steps into car number three. The interior is bright, clean, and quiet. He walks down the narrow central aisle, checking the small numbers printed above each row.\n\nHe finds seat twenty-two next to a wide glass window. He lifts his heavy backpack and places it securely into the overhead luggage rack. Then, he sits down in the soft blue seat.\n\nA friendly conductor in uniform walks through the coach, welcoming everyone aboard. Outside, the station platform begins to move slowly backward as the train starts its journey toward the high peaks.",
